---
// Animated "photo -> AI -> weekly schedule" demo of AI timetable import.
---
<div class="imp" data-import>
  <div class="imp-step s1">
    <span class="imp-n">1</span>
    <div class="paper" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="paper-h">B.Tech CSE · Sem 3 · Timetable</div>
      <div class="grid-t">
        <span></span><b>Mon</b><b>Tue</b><b>Wed</b>
        <b>9–10</b><span>DS</span><span>LA</span><span>DS</span>
        <b>11–12</b><span>LA</span><span>OS</span><span>CN</span>
        <b>2–3:30</b><span>—</span><span>CN Lab</span><span>OS</span>
      </div>
      <div class="scan"></div>
    </div>
    <h3>Snap, upload or paste</h3>
    <p>A photo of the noticeboard, the PDF from your portal, or text.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="imp-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
  <div class="imp-step s2">
    <span class="imp-n">2</span>
    <div class="ai-box" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/img/mascot-think.webp" alt="" width="64" height="64" />
      <div class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <small>Reading 9 classes…</small>
    </div>
    <h3>AI reads every class</h3>
    <p>Subjects, days, times and rooms, usually in seconds.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="imp-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
  <div class="imp-step s3">
    <span class="imp-n">3</span>
    <ul class="found" aria-label="Example of classes found">
      <li style="--c:#EAE5FA"><strong>Data Structures</strong> Mon, Wed 9:00</li>
      <li style="--c:#FBF1CE"><strong>Linear Algebra</strong> Mon 11:00, Tue 9:00</li>
      <li style="--c:#DFF3E7"><strong>Computer Networks</strong> Wed 11:00 + Tue lab</li>
      <li style="--c:#E1EAF6"><strong>Operating Systems</strong> Tue 11:00, Wed 2:00</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Review, then save</h3>
    <p>Fix anything, tap save. Your week and reminders are ready.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .imp { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: start; margin-top: 48px; }
  .imp-step { background: #fff; border-radius: var(--r-lg); padding: 22px; position: relative; min-height: 100%; }
  .imp-step h3 { margin: 16px 0 4px; }
  .imp-step p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: .93rem; }
  .imp-n { position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 18px; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ink); color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: .85rem; }
  .imp-arrow { align-self: center; font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--cta); font-weight: 700; }
  .paper { position: relative; background: #FFFDF6; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; transform: rotate(-2deg); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #EFE7CF; overflow: hidden; height: 170px; }
  .paper-h { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .grid-t { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 4px; font-size: .7rem; }
  .grid-t b { font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }
  .grid-t span { background: #F2EEE0; border-radius: 4px; padding: 3px 4px; text-align: center; }
  .scan { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; height: 36px; background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(108,92,231,.28), transparent); animation: scan 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes scan { 0% { top: -36px; } 100% { top: 170px; } }
  .ai-box { height: 170px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--lavender); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; }
  .ai-box img { width: 64px; animation: bob 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .ai-box small { color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 500; }
  @keyframes bob { 50% { transform: translateY(-6px); } }
  .bars { display: flex; gap: 5px; }
  .bars i { width: 34px; height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--cta); opacity: .3; animation: load 1.2s infinite; }
  .bars i:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .2s; } .bars i:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .4s; }
  @keyframes load { 50% { opacity: 1; } }
  .found { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; height: 170px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .found li { background: var(--c); border-radius: 10px; padding: 7px 10px; font-size: .78rem; color: var(--ink-2); animation: in .4s backwards; }
  .found li strong { display: block; color: var(--ink); font-size: .84rem; }
  .found li:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: .3s; } .found li:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .7s; } .found li:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 1.1s; } .found li:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 1.5s; }
  @keyframes in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .found li { opacity: 1; } }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .imp { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; } .imp-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); justify-self: center; } }
</style>
